lgunos sueños tienen botones en la esquina inferior derecha que te transportarán de vuelta; los que no lo harán automáticamente. En orden de construcción; Museo de Shell Atrium Tornados Toro Cany####es Pluto Boat in the Cottonwoods Neon Industrial Canal Train It's Time (cw: themes of death of ########) Herons Si quieres un lugar para comenzar, te sugiero; Pluto, Train, It's Time, Herons, o Domes.","tags":["#clippings"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[[16,18]],"last_embed":{"hash":"1buc7wj","at":1779677751230},"key":"Clippings/Diario de Sueños de Roblox.md"},"smart_blocks:Clippings/Diario de Sueños de Roblox.md#": {"path":null,"last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{"TaylorAI/bge-micro-v2":{"vec":null}},"text":null,"length":0,"last_read":{"hash":"ysd0nt","at":1779254182681},"key":"Clippings/Diario de Sueños de Roblox.md#","lines":[12,13],"size":79,"outlinks":[{"title":"@xX66demonslayer66Xx","target":"https://www.roblox.com/es/users/1896501500/profile/","line":1}],"class_name":"SmartBlock"},
